   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Training",
   "texto": [
    "In many verbs, take the **ils** form of the present, remove **-ent** and add **-e, -es, -e, -ions, -iez, -ent**: **ils parlent** → **que je parle**.",
    "Some verbs change root between **je/tu/il/ils** and **nous/vous**: **ils viennent** → **qu'ils viennent**, but **nous venons** → **que nous venions**. Others, like **pouvoir**, have a root of their own: **que je puisse, que nous puissions**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
